level on various fronts.

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:33.390
So for example, we have consequences

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:36.360
for the analysis of historical transition

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:38.790
to capitalism and how
we interpret the problem

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:43.790
