00:34:06.440 --> 00:34:08.230
of the way in which primitive accumulation

00:34:08.230 --> 00:34:11.103
actually impacted on women.

00:34:13.520 --> 00:34:16.890
So before concluding this
first part of my lecture

00:34:16.890 --> 00:34:18.650
and moving on now to our discussion

