00:35:05.080 --> 00:35:09.683
because otherwise, again, we
fall into circular reasoning.

00:35:10.930 --> 00:35:13.650
So these people were doing horrible things

00:35:13.650 --> 00:35:15.960
but they were not doing them

00:35:15.960 --> 00:35:19.140
because they had in mind
that the development

00:35:19.140 --> 00:35:21.450
of a capitalist mode of production

00:35:21.450 --> 00:35:24.173
they did them for different reasons.

00:35:25.040 --> 00:35:29.340
Moreover, Marx must also avoid falling

00:35:29.340 --> 00:35:33.230
into a philosophy of history
for which the emergence

00:35:33.230 --> 00:35:34.950
of capitalism was inscribed

00:35:34.950 --> 00:35:37.520
in some kind (mumbles) laws of linear

00:35:37.520 --> 00:35:39.450
