00:35:53.560 --> 00:35:58.560
So in order to avoid these
two possible mistakes

00:36:00.380 --> 00:36:04.460
which unfortunately
later Marx did not avoid

00:36:04.460 --> 00:36:08.210
especially the second one
Marx needs to be able to show

00:36:08.210 --> 00:36:13.210
