of processes that are not of their making

00:37:52.460 --> 00:37:55.120
in order to dominate
end up dominating both

00:37:55.120 --> 00:37:56.320
landlords and (mumbles).

00:37:57.267 --> 00:38:00.423
So in other words like
the (mumbles) we do have,

00:38:02.140 --> 00:38:05.660
