00:38:36.070 --> 00:38:39.773
Finally, I want to
reiterate the fact that,

00:38:40.970 --> 00:38:44.250
and also to push back against criticism

00:38:44.250 --> 00:38:48.023
so Marx's account of primitive
accumulation as Eurocentric.

00:38:49.500 --> 00:38:53.870
I mean, that one could accuse
Marx of being Euro-centric

00:38:53.870 --> 00:38:56.970
