00:40:07.970 --> 00:40:10.763
So I'm going to share this again.

00:40:12.150 --> 00:40:12.983
So,

00:40:15.367 --> 00:40:17.710
"The expropriation of
the agricultural producer

00:40:17.710 --> 00:40:19.100
of the peasant from the soil

00:40:19.100 --> 00:40:21.610
