00:40:34.350 --> 00:40:35.210
Only in England

00:40:35.210 --> 00:40:39.383
which we therefore take as our
example as its classic form.

00:40:41.480 --> 00:40:45.550
So these two remarks on the fact

00:40:53.790 --> 00:40:55.830
that we are not really dealing

00:40:57.180 --> 00:40:59.660
