of primitive accumulation

00:40:59.660 --> 00:41:02.530
but with an example, in an example

00:41:02.530 --> 00:41:05.910
that as Marx (muffled speaking) says

00:41:05.910 --> 00:41:09.010
cannot be applied to other realities

00:41:09.010 --> 00:41:12.110
because historical contingency

00:41:12.110 --> 00:41:13.460
because historical processes

00:41:13.460 --> 00:41:16.720
