00:44:01.440 --> 00:44:06.300
and is analysis of transition, however

00:44:07.800 --> 00:44:12.800
political consequences
now in relation to this

00:44:15.170 --> 00:44:19.350
first of all, the theological reading

00:44:19.350 --> 00:44:22.810
