00:47:40.240 --> 00:47:45.240
the accumulation capital
written in 1913 especially

00:47:45.500 --> 00:47:47.827
the conclusion of the texts
where (muffled speaking),

00:47:48.690 --> 00:47:51.470
that capital has a need

00:47:51.470 --> 00:47:55.280
for ever expanding into
non-capitalist zones.

00:47:55.280 --> 00:47:59.660
And this need is what explains
