00:48:27.260 --> 00:48:30.330
Now, recent readings of primitive
accumulation, for example

00:48:30.330 --> 00:48:32.400
by David Harvey, most famously

00:48:34.020 --> 00:48:36.450
but all other authors
as well, like Massimo

00:48:37.480 --> 00:48:38.580
(muffled speaking)

00:48:38.580 --> 00:48:41.770
and others go a step farther in the sense

00:48:41.770 --> 00:48:46.770
that what is geographical
outside in Rosa Luxembourg

00:48:49.360 --> 00:48:52.680
