00:48:59.480 --> 00:49:01.960
itself in this accounts

00:49:01.960 --> 00:49:05.520
it is constantly reproduced
within capitalism itself.

00:49:05.520 --> 00:49:09.680
It needs to be constantly
appropriated by capital.

00:49:09.680 --> 00:49:12.260
And therefore we do have a process

00:49:12.260 --> 00:49:14.573
of ongoing primitive accumulation.

00:49:15.760 --> 00:49:19.340
And now we do some impossible
to give full justice

00:49:19.340 --> 00:49:20.660
to the argument.

00:49:20.660 --> 00:49:25.660
And I must say they are
the arguments by all those

00:49:26.560 --> 00:49:29.810
supporting the national
ongoing primitive accumulation

00:49:29.810 --> 00:49:31.650
not necessarily the same.

00:49:31.650 --> 00:49:33.630
So there are differences

00:49:33.630 --> 00:49:36.653
different accounts I'm going to focus on.

00:49:38.306 --> 00:49:40.650
I'm going to just say a few brief words

00:49:40.650 --> 00:49:43.980
on David Harveys on account

00:49:43.980 --> 00:49:47.450
of what do you call
accumulation by dispossession

00:49:48.610 --> 00:49:51.230
and just to really summarize

00:49:51.230 --> 00:49:53.863
and simplify in a very brutal way

00:49:55.540 --> 00:49:58.630
Harvey makes two quick key claims.

00:49:58.630 --> 00:50:01.570
One is that accumulation by dispossession

00:50:01.570 --> 00:50:04.940
that is ongoing primitive
accumulation is always

00:50:04.940 --> 00:50:07.740
a background condition
for accumulation as well

00:50:07.740 --> 00:50:11.360
as additional value and for
capitals expanded reproduction.

00:50:11.360 --> 00:50:16.360
So we do have the
exploitation of labor power

00:50:17.120 --> 00:50:19.000
within the black production process

00:50:19.000 --> 00:50:21.410
and therefore the process
of what a recession of value

00:50:21.410 --> 00:50:24.370
but we also have accumulation

00:50:24.370 --> 00:50:27.246
by dispossession as a
constant background condition.

00:50:27.246 --> 00:50:32.246
So what makes it possible
for value to take place?

00:50:33.740 --> 00:50:38.740
The second main claim is that
in contemporary capitalism

00:50:39.000 --> 00:50:42.650
accumulation by dispossession has emerged

00:50:42.650 --> 00:50:44.400
from its background state.

00:50:44.400 --> 00:50:47.920
So it's not a background
condition anymore.

00:50:47.920 --> 00:50:51.990
It does become much
more salient after 1973

00:50:53.944 --> 00:50:56.130
in order to address
capitalist crisis produced

00:50:56.130 --> 00:51:00.800
by capitalism and ability to
continue realizing profit.

00:51:00.800 --> 00:51:04.817
And it does become basically
the key distinctive

00:51:08.690 --> 00:51:12.690
feature of neoliberal capitalism.

00:51:12.690 --> 00:51:16.680
Now, in other words, in my view

00:51:16.680 --> 00:51:21.300
what Harvey does is to
basically identify accumulation

00:51:21.300 --> 00:51:23.973
by dispossession and
privatizing neoliberalism.

00:51:25.170 --> 00:51:27.033
So accumulation by dispossession

00:51:27.033 --> 00:51:31.550
and his account ends up being
equal to commodification

00:51:31.550 --> 00:51:34.673
and privatization of land privatization

00:51:34.673 --> 00:51:36.773
and commodification of the public services

00:51:38.770 --> 00:51:43.020
and assets financialization
on an international scale

00:51:43.020 --> 00:51:45.880
being the main vehicle of this processes

00:51:47.780 --> 00:51:51.230
on other accounts of ongoing
primitive accumulation

00:51:51.230 --> 00:51:55.840
the key aspect to be taken
into consideration is the need

00:51:55.840 --> 00:51:59.460
of constantly rebel using
capitalist social relations

00:51:59.460 --> 00:52:02.190
and these mantra institutions
that protect sociality

00:52:02.190 --> 00:52:03.023
from the market.

00:52:03.023 --> 00:52:05.550
This is for example,
Massimo De Angelis take

00:52:05.550 --> 00:52:06.980
on primitive accumulation.

00:52:06.980 --> 00:52:09.870
There is a constant
struggle within capitalism,

00:52:12.260 --> 00:52:16.050
between a push to basically decommodify

00:52:16.050 --> 00:52:20.850
or preserve areas of life
free of commodification

00:52:20.850 --> 00:52:25.850
and so on now and violent
processes of ongoing primitive

00:52:26.357 --> 00:52:27.610
accumulation to reappropriate

00:52:28.728 --> 00:52:32.200
to foreclose the spaces
that are constantly opened

00:52:32.200 --> 00:52:33.313
within capitalism.

00:52:34.570 --> 00:52:38.123
Now, what is the problem
with these accounts?

00:52:39.060 --> 00:52:41.670
The first problem is
that with this accounts

00:52:41.670 --> 00:52:43.500
of ongoing primitive accumulation

00:52:43.500 --> 00:52:46.844
we entirely lose the notion of transition.

00:52:46.844 --> 00:52:47.777
So in other words, the
national primitive accumulation

00:52:48.820 --> 00:52:51.760
in Marx is meant to explain,

00:52:51.760 --> 00:52:56.517
how was it historically
possible for capital to emerge?

00:52:57.700 --> 00:52:58.860
And this is the function

00:52:58.860 --> 00:53:00.363
that the concept has.

00:53:02.110 --> 00:53:03.520
From this viewpoint

00:53:03.520 --> 00:53:08.520
primitive accumulation not
always entails this possession

00:53:10.320 --> 00:53:12.330
but the opposite is not the case.

00:53:12.330 --> 00:53:14.510
So in other words, this possession

00:53:14.510 --> 00:53:17.980
or dispossession do not
necessarily entail processes

00:53:17.980 --> 00:53:19.550
of primitive accumulation.

00:53:19.550 --> 00:53:24.550
They can just be dispossession
and and privatization

00:53:24.631 --> 00:53:27.450
and commodification as prompted

00:53:27.450 --> 00:53:30.960
by the very logic of
capitalist accumulation

00:53:30.960 --> 00:53:33.060
and by the dynamics of the struggle.

00:53:33.060 --> 00:53:34.490
So, in other words, in some periods

00:53:34.490 --> 00:53:39.490
you will have a much stronger
push, like the liberal period

00:53:40.570 --> 00:53:43.710
towards privatization of
financialization and so on.

00:53:43.710 --> 00:53:48.110
And this is in part due to the inner logic

00:53:48.110 --> 00:53:49.350
of capitalist accumulation

00:53:49.350 --> 00:53:52.280
the necessity of overcoming
the crisis in '73

00:53:52.280 --> 00:53:53.990
but it also has to do with class struggle.

00:53:53.990 --> 00:53:58.240
So in other words, the
defeat of the what is moment

00:53:58.240 --> 00:54:02.130
of class struggle everywhere,
basically on the planet

00:54:02.130 --> 00:54:06.803
and therefore the lesser capacity
to resist these processes.

00:54:08.170 --> 00:54:09.640
So what I'm suggesting is that

00:54:09.640 --> 00:54:14.170
at least in some accounts
I have in mind, for example

00:54:14.170 --> 00:54:18.930
the Angeles here, basically the risk

00:54:18.930 --> 00:54:21.320
is to see primitive accumulation.

00:54:21.320 --> 00:54:24.930
Every time there is a
class struggle (chuckles)

00:54:24.930 --> 00:54:27.990
and every time discussed
struggle is somehow lost.

00:54:27.990 --> 00:54:32.510
And therefore, something
is taken away from us

00:54:32.510 --> 00:54:36.210
in terms of commodification
of aspects of life.

00:54:36.210 --> 00:54:38.733
Art is life privatizations and so on.

00:54:45.000 --> 00:54:48.740
If we lump together
privatization and dispossession.

00:54:48.740 --> 00:54:50.760
So basically we see every process

00:54:50.760 --> 00:54:52.610
of dispossession or every process

00:54:52.610 --> 00:54:57.610
of privatization we'd as basically
a primitive accumulation.

00:54:59.610 --> 00:55:02.130
Then my fear is that we make the concept

00:55:02.130 --> 00:55:07.120
of much emptier and
therefore more abstract

00:55:07.120 --> 00:55:10.920
and therefore much less useful to analyze

00:55:10.920 --> 00:55:14.070
and understand what the
concept was meant to analyze

00:55:14.070 --> 00:55:16.823
and understand that is
the problem of transition.

00:55:21.630 --> 00:55:26.630
Okay, so as I have already mentioned

00:55:29.000 --> 00:55:30.480
I do not think

00:55:30.480 --> 00:55:34.540
that we do need a national
ongoing primitive accumulation

00:55:34.540 --> 00:55:36.790
in order to explain the
role of dispossession

00:55:36.790 --> 00:55:39.790
of this within capitalist societies.

00:55:39.790 --> 00:55:43.330
So the role of continuous
dispossession and so on

00:55:44.660 --> 00:55:47.440
and we should also take

00:55:47.440 --> 00:55:49.867
into account the fact that it is true.

00:55:49.867 --> 00:55:54.867
The Marx basically that speak of the fact

00:55:55.490 --> 00:56:00.490
