00:59:05.730 --> 00:59:09.410
but I actually do think
that there are serious

00:59:09.410 --> 00:59:13.710
consequences if we adopt
one view or another

00:59:13.710 --> 00:59:17.240
because what they think characterizes

00:59:17.240 --> 00:59:20.570
most of the the battle
stakes on ongoing primitive

00:59:20.570 --> 00:59:25.570
accumulation and is
internalization has saved

00:59:27.330 --> 00:59:29.403
the outside that needs to be reproduced.

00:59:30.370 --> 00:59:34.460
What characterized, in spite
