00:59:41.460 --> 00:59:46.460
or paracidic rather than as productive.

00:59:48.720 --> 00:59:51.980
And my worry here is

00:59:51.980 --> 00:59:56.930
that this really makes
capital not very different

00:59:56.930 --> 01:00:01.930
