01:00:16.690 --> 01:00:20.643
So, what it was my concern
is that by thinking that,

01:00:21.482 --> 01:00:24.280
valorization of value now has, for example

01:00:24.280 --> 01:00:27.190
being replaced by other forms
of accumulation, for example

01:00:27.190 --> 01:00:29.527
by dispossession as the main model.

01:00:29.527 --> 01:00:34.410
And so on what we run the risk of missing

01:00:34.410 --> 01:00:36.300
is the central aspect

01:00:36.300 --> 01:00:39.780
of capital as a revolutionary,
not in positive sense

01:00:39.780 --> 01:00:44.780
expansive and global
force, which we can get

01:00:44.880 --> 01:00:49.880
If we keep our attention

01:00:50.090 --> 01:00:55.090
