01:37:47.060 --> 01:37:49.760
undifferentiated free labor and so on.

01:37:49.760 --> 01:37:52.960
This is probably capitalist's phenomenon

01:37:52.960 --> 01:37:56.550
but it is also legacy in
the sense and afterlife

01:37:56.550 --> 01:37:59.700
of the way in which transition worked

01:37:59.700 --> 01:38:03.510
within in the United States and so on

01:38:04.437 --> 01:38:06.230
