or not as a remnant

01:38:31.171 --> 01:38:34.150
of the past and not as
a ghost from the past

01:38:34.150 --> 01:38:39.130
but as something that is
subsumed by the very form

01:38:39.130 --> 01:38:44.130
of capital in a given
situation, this applies

01:38:44.230 --> 01:38:49.230
