01:40:07.610 --> 01:40:10.880
it doesn't mean that is an anachronism

01:40:10.880 --> 01:40:13.003
or just a ghost of the past.

01:40:13.880 --> 01:40:16.080
It means that it is an element

01:40:16.080 --> 01:40:19.480
of the genesis or capital that has become

01:40:20.440 --> 01:40:23.563
constitutive feature or vocabulary self.

